  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\nTargets whose names differ only in letter case (#334, closes #316). Registering two targets such as IFoo and Ifoo made the generator fail with CS8785, and no imposter of the project was generated. Roslyn compares generated file names ignoring case, so the two files clashed. Such targets' files now get a hash of the target's name in their file name, as generic targets' files already do. Every other file keeps its name.\n\nPerformance\n\nCalls allocate less (#321, closes #315). Every call to an impersonated method, property or indexer used to allocate an enumerator to look for callbacks, even when none were registered. It now skips the lookup when there are none:\n\na property getter call no longer allocates;\n\na method call allocates 144 bytes instead of 216;\n\na property setter call 32 instead of 104;\n\nan indexer getter call 104 instead of 176;\n\nan indexer setter call 64 instead of 144.",
